. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mr2rxltiH1cQ7kNvwG-YUsl&_nc_oc=Adq4Q78F599zSP8aNhf2YDEF-CHpVp68vaqIjEgcMrgQLNb-_zdYYnZcUyxolvZWpDs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3waI4ak-Vkx3IE9J3Jcu7_8KZrG3vpV29Mz-aOKYDQ4A&oe=69ECBB3E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sqCl7oB2btsQ7kNvwFV-vAX&_nc_oc=Adook42XVa3_vX6PEnW0P_hf3Mk_zsYcgWgd1vMhEYHnoMZ4-RsMKfmZ2SSn06sRNgE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3n4rTeNvjp0hjeBqvJ56UanxmYI1kkm6pIj79Pwpmijw&oe=69ECD1DE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pbEo7r_xhRkQ7kNvwE2Bhb0&_nc_oc=Adp29w7nOpYfi6m2R5VePF2PcuAtX783lN3cT4AJMo3_tjM70Me652gmyFlyKNJyxIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af16NmIHftcpJ69IvYvajQ0ejdIAJZG1nPy-iCdB3LNI8A&oe=69ECC75B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco